    <dcterms:title>The Cricket on the Hearth: A Fairy Tale of Home</dcterms:title>
    <dcterms:description>Wikipedia page about this book: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Cricket_on_the_Hearth</dcterms:description>
    <dcterms:description>Project Gutenberg has several editions of this eBook:&#13;
#20795  (Some B &amp; W illustrations)&#13;
